WEBVTT

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:28.670
Crap...

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:32.430
Is that you, Bonjiri?

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.470
It is you.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:40.480
You are Bonjiri, aren't you?

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.110
I'll give you a push.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:53.070
Th-Thanks...

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.960
"Affordable Chinese Food"
"Ichibanya"
"Number 1 in taste!"
"Number 1 in price!"

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:35.860
"MEGALOBOX 2"

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:46.770
"Affordable Chinese Food Ichibanya"

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:46.690
I guess we can hold a
welcome-back-to-the-dumps party for him.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:52.570
The headline will read, "After Five Years,
the Legendary Champion,

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:56.660
'Gearless' Joe, Returns After Being
Defeated by Liu and Disappearing."

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.990
If we can get an exclusive interview,
we'll make a fortune!

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:02.410
Santa, are you being serious right now?

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.370
Of course.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.290
He abandoned us and left.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:10.090
Unlike you guys, I don't ever
remember being abandoned.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:12.550
You call yourself a reporter,

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:17.380
but all you do is scuttle around
the ring like some stray.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.720
And what does that make you, then?

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:24.270
I guess your bark is worse than your bite
since you're just Fujimaki's pet.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:27.350
If you've got a problem with that,
work your way up to an official match.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.770
Then I'll write an article about you.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:32.820
Give a rest, you two.

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:35.030
Get us some beer and some gyoza.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:37.530
Hey, didn't you hear him?

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.910
The owner's out on a delivery right now.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.370
Delivery?

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:44.830
He'll be back soon, so you
can drink this while you wait.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:48.370
Then why don't you keep me
company until then, missy?

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.420
Pretty sure you got the wrong shop.

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.800
And I'm pretty sure I don't.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:55.960
Let go of her!

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.850
What? She your girl?

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:05.220
She doesn't belong to anyone! Let go!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.390
Give it a rest, Kunimura.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:16.280
I thought I'd seen you before,

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.820
but you're one of the boxers
from Drunk Monk, aren't ya?

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.530
And what if I am?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:24.200
I don't want any trouble
outside of the ring.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:27.790
Hold up, Mr. Hashimoto!
This kid's a Megalo-boxer?

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.370
You can't be serious!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:34.750
This kid insists on fighting clean,
even in the underground ring.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.760
Though I've also heard he's just too weak,

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:39.260
so it's hard to fix any
fights with him anyway.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:42.800
That's hilarious!

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.060
I'm back.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:47.220
Took you long enough!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.640
You always make the
customers wait at this shop?

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.100
Sorry about that.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.270
Two orders of gyoza. Hurry it up!

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.440
Y-Yes, sir.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.360
Also, this one's on the house, isn't it?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.780
Huh? Yes, of course...

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:05.490
It better be since we were nice enough to
step foot into your crummy little shop.

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.910
So about tonight...

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.670
Wait, Sachio!

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:21.220
The hell do you think you're doing?!

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.930
It's on the house.

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:24.680
What? You need another one?

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:28.140
You're gonna pay for that!

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.730
This is bad, Sachio.

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:36.150
This is your shop.
Don't let them run the place.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:46.200
You took a while getting
back from that delivery.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:49.750
Huh? Oh, I was just...

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.000
Wait, did you...?

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:56.630
N-No! Why would I go down to the riverbed?

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.010
Jeez, you're easy to read.

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:21.940
Ah, that's the wrong one.
No wonder it doesn't fit.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.370
Why don't we take a breather?

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:44.220
You should really quit smoking.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:46.510
Even though we know
we'll regret it someday,

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.800
we keep choosing the easy way out.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:52.020
People, sadly, aren't that bright.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:53.850
Who exactly are you talking about?

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:05.190
Gym
Nowhere

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:05.110
You're just running away to the ring, Joe!

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:07.910
I just...

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.740
We're not a team anymore.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:10.950
We're finished!

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:18.170
Sachio!

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.000
We're not really finished, are we?

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:38.270
It's not that match
I can't forgive him for.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:43.110
It's the fact that he abandoned
everything right after and ran away.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.490
I mean... It's because of
that Sachio ended up...

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:09.180
Hey, you alive, Pipsqueak?

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:11.550
It's not your bedtime just yet!

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.890
Come on! Entertain us a little longer!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.390
"Affordable Chinese Food Ichibanya"

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:29.230
Is 'Gearless Joe' Coming Back to the Ring After 5 Years?! Delete this file?

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:29.230
Yes

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:29.230
No

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:36.570
"Team Nowhere"
"Team Nowhere Returns!
Opens Up a New Gym!!"

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.750
What'd you come back for, anyway?

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.050
Hot!

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:06.780
Heya.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:08.740
Come on in...

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.080
Sachio!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:25.750
Joe...

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.230
RESTAURANT

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:32.550
The guy that Sachio
injured is a small-time

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.050
Megalo-boxer that's on the road.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:39.520
He demanded that I pay him reparations
and he took the deed to the shop.

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:40.770
Where's Sachio?

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:47.360
He said, "This is my responsibility,
so I'll go get it back."

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:49.490
I tried to stop him,
but he just wouldn't listen.

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:58.040
Is this true, kid?

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.240
Yeah.

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:05.250
You've got some nerve acting tough when
you can't even bring in a dime!

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.920
How the hell do ya plan on settling this?

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:11.220
I'll do this fight! You guys
can take the prize money!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.930
That's not even enough to
cover the bandages. Ow...

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:17.510
I'm the one who did this!
Give back the deed!

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.520
You mean, "May I have the
deed back, please," don't ya?

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.110
May I have the deed back, please?

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.870
All right. On one condition.

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:39.450
You need to win this match.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.290
If you can do that,
you can have the deed back.

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:51.840
Yo, Ushiyama. Looks like you're
fighting this runt today, not me.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.800
Looks like you're gonna
get an actual fight.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:59.300
Good for you, kid.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:18.490
A stray that I hadn't seen for a while

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:23.750
is now wandering around the
same garbage dump as before.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.580
That just means even if
you can get your collar off,

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:29.210
you'll never be able to undo this chain.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:33.840
Did you come to take back
what you threw away, Joe?

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:41.600
I hate to break it to you,
but he's not the same kid anymore.

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:44.770
And that's fine.

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.190
I didn't come back
to get back what I lost.

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:54.070
I just want to protect what's here now.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:03.660
Beating that runt to a pulp
isn't gonna satisfy me.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.080
Come on, don't be like that.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:07.960
We'll treat you to some
Chinese food later.

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:14.840
Sorry, but there's been a change of plans.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:19.630
That's--

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.390
What the hell are you doing here?!

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:23.560
This doesn't concern you!

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.560
What the hell's going on?!

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:33.360
This is my ring.

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:35.400
I make the rules.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:47.790
Will our fighters make it savagely rain
blood in the ring yet again tonight?!

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:56.050
The Executioner of the Ring!
Butcher Ushiyama!

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:06.060
Hey, what's going on, Sachio?!

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:10.060
Did you talk things out?

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:11.900
What happened to the deed?

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:13.980
Hey, Sachio!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.820
Apparently he's gonna get it back instead.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:22.530
Ladies and Gentlemen, there has been a
sudden change in our matchup tonight.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:25.990
Fighting for Condor Kunimura
due to an injury...

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:28.830
He is finally making his comeback tonight!

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:33.540
The legendary champion is back!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.090
"Gearless" Joe!

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:43.970
All those scars...

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:46.140
Wh-Why is Joe fighting?

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:48.020
Fujimaki's decision.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:50.560
Apparently, I'm not making him any money.

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.020
Sachio!

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:06.330
In this venue, where the
first Megalonia was held,

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:09.240
the exhibition match between
Yuri's prized pupil Liu

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:16.210
and the legendary champion,
"Gearless" Joe, is about to begin!

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:22.750
What's up?

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.550
Ten minutes before the match.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:26.550
It's time.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.060
Yeah.

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:29.260
What?!

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:31.060
All right. We'll head right over.

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:33.310
Sachio just said Pops' condition
suddenly took a turn for the worst!

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.560
He's in critical condition!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.980
But he was doing great yesterday!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.360
Yeah! So why...

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.230
Joe...

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.320
Go to him.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:45.570
I promised Pops.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.370
I told him I'd stay here and fight.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:54.920
Joe, wait! Don't go!

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.750
You guys hurry to the hospital.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.840
Don't worry. Leave Joe to me.

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:04.510
Let's hurry.

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:05.380
Yeah...

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:06.800
Oicho...

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:10.560
I'm gonna stay here.

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.520
Five minutes before the match.

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:32.580
I bet everything on you, Joe!

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:33.950
Same here!

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:44.300
I finally get to meet you.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.550
You're gonna have to hit harder
than that if you wanna reach me.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.650
Joe's moves are on point tonight.

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:02.570
It's hard to believe he's been
away for a year and a half.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.530
Bring it on!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:19.920
Joe!

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:28.970
I'm sure you don't
need me to tell you this.

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:31.010
You're definitely more skilled,

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:34.310
but you can't gain back the stamina
you lost away from the ring.

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:37.730
That's what he's gonna aim for.
Don't draw this out too long.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.190
End it in the next round.

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:50.450
What the hell's going on?

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:52.530
The champ's getting pushed around.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.330
"Unlimited Rounds"

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:26.940
One!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.740
Two!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.740
Joe!

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:30.400
Three!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.910
Four!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.570
Five!

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:35.410
Six!

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:37.160
Seven!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:38.790
Eight!

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:40.410
Nine!

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.250
Ten!

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:43.540
Joe!

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:52.930
Unbelievable! The newcomer Liu has
defeated the legendary "Gearless" Joe!

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:57.560
The legend has come to an end,
welcoming in a new age!

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:01.230
Joe!

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:04.440
It's not over...

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.650
It's not over yet!

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:13.950
Joe! It's all right, Joe! It's over!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:17.030
But it can't be over!

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:19.410
Please! I'm begging you!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:21.960
That's enough!

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:24.330
Let's just hurry up and go see Pops!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.460
Joe, please!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.460
Joe!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:40.310
Legend, my ass! You phony ass champion!

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:43.020
You pathetic loser!

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:45.980
Shoulda just stayed gone!

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:47.940
Greatest, my ass!

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:52.900
Let's go.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:03.330
"Affordable Chinese Food Ichibanya"

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:12.010
Hey. I decided to
celebrate a little early.

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:18.050
What? Now everything's just
happily ever after, right?

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.350
He lost.

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:24.690
There's no way he'd lose!

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:27.600
What are you yelling at me for?

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:30.230
More importantly, what are
you gonna do now, Bonjiri?

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.070
They took your shop.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:46.700
Registered Deed

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:46.620
This is...

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:51.800
Sachio, sorry I butted in.

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:54.550
Huh? But how? You...

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:57.840
I knew it.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.510
I thought it was weird.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:04.060
There's no way you could've lost after
having moves like that at the start.

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:06.810
So it was a fixed fight?!
You really are a piece of shit!

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:11.440
This is about all I can
do for you right now.

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:16.240
You really don't change, do you?

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.820
It's just like before.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:22.490
You didn't discuss it with us at all

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.950
and went ahead and made
such a decision on your own.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.250
Are you just gonna abandon
everything and run away again?

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.420
I'm not going to say thank you.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:37.510
I'm asking you to leave us alone for good.

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:47.520
Oicho's right. I'm sorry, guys.

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:55.190
He's got some nerve.

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:57.990
Did he really think we'd forget
everything just because of this?

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:09.210
Joe's gonna get wet out there.

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:12.250
I told him.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:19.300
I told him to never show
his face around here again.

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:43.950
You're not part of our family anymore.

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:47.490
Sachio...

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:51.370
Leave. Don't ever show your
face around here again.

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:06.760
So he didn't actually abandon us.

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:08.060
But I mean...

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:13.400
I can't trust someone who'd actually
leave just because he was told to...

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:17.230
Yeah. He's just gonna
disappear again anyway.

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:27.990
It's already been five years...
